# Tokens for customers' GitHub repositories (ADR-0021). Copy to .env.github; never commit that file.
# Only the integration-worker container loads it. One variable per customer repository:
#   - name: GITHUB_TOKEN_ followed by capital letters, digits or underscores
#   - value: a fine-grained personal access token limited to that one repository,
#     with "Issues: Read and write", "Metadata: Read" and "Contents: Read-only"
#   - the CTO can save tokens on screen instead (Projects > GitHub tokens) and check them with "Check permissions"
# After adding a token: docker compose up -d integration-worker
GITHUB_TOKEN_EXAMPLE=
